# Evaluator-owned receipts are committed; harness state, workspaces, raw harness logs and per-trial tokens are not.
trials/*/*/*/state/
trials/*/*/*/workspace/
trials/*/*/*/logs/
trials/*/*/*/trial.json
trials/*/*/*/compose.serve.yaml
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
# The run, proxy, preflight and build logs of each shard are receipts this run's report cites (the repository's root rule ignores *.log).
!*.run.log
!*.proxy.log
!*.preflight.log
!*.clean-arm-preflight.log
!*.first-launch.build-gbrain.log
!backup-loop.log
